; DT818_pro - Combined FBO + ORB + LSFVG, all 3% risk, Apr 25 WFO
; Next WFO: May 9 2026
;
; 4 streams sharing single $10k account (3% risk per trade):
;   FBO S1 (M30 fractal)  magic 1000 cmt FBO_A
;   FBO S2 (M15 fractal)  magic 1000 cmt FBO_B
;   ORB    (M5  session)  magic 2000 cmt ORB
;   LSFVG  (M15 SMC)      magic 3000 cmt LSFVG
;
; Daily caps are STREAM-LOCAL (each stream tracks its own magic, locks only itself):
;   FBO   : DISABLED (FBO was WFO'd unconstrained)
;   ORB   : 27% target / 18% loss  (3x ORB WFO baseline 9/6)
;   LSFVG : DISABLED (sparse strategy, caps would prematurely lock)
;
; Sanity ET (Feb 14 -> Apr 25, $10k, deal-merge on shared account):
;   COMBINED: NP +$29,366 (+293.7% ROI) / DD 18.6% / NP/DD 3.44 / 609 trades
;     FBO_S1 contrib: +$3,000  (27 trades)
;     FBO_S2 contrib: +$7,968  (406 trades)
;     ORB    contrib: +$16,477 (144 trades)
;     LSFVG  contrib: +$1,921  (32 trades)
;
; Aggressive variant (4.5% risk) available at: dt818_pro_4_5pct_apr25_reopt_may9.set
;   That variant: +461% ROI / 25.5% DD / NP/DD 2.58 — higher absolute but worse efficiency.

; ===== Global account =====
_CapitalProtectionAmount=0.0||0.0||1||0.0||0.0||N
